'''Growing Evil''' (進化の悪マタタビ, ''Ahinka no Aku Matatabi'', '''Aku Actinidia of Evolution''') is a [[Catfruit]] gathering event that is available on all days of the week, but only for a period of time. By clearing any of these stages, you might get an Aku Seed, but you can't use the [[Battle Items|Golden Cat CPU]] to clear them immediately. You also have a guaranteed chance to get one Aku Seed upon clearing the third stage. This event is only available after clearing [[The Gates of Aku|Unleashing the Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 10.10 Update|Version 10.10]].

